5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,Let's decide our destination. I want to understand our group dynamics better this time. I'll look into the time alone in the shared-house year and how last year's days ran.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds wise, Mizuki. I am concerned about how we handle the costs. I will check the all-in rates against meals bought separately and what separately booked rooms cost last time.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I want to make sure I can sleep and relax. I'll look into bathing hours and bathroom provision, and inn mealtimes and room arrangements.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I would like to minimize the time spent on logistics. I'll check ferry sailings and train time, and getting around by train and bus.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with Shizue; clear costs are important. I'll look into the pricing of offshore houses let whole and valley inn rates versus urban beds.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
