55,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,I vote for Option A. It provides the right balance of togetherness and independence.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Shizue,,I also vote for Option A. The financial arrangement is the most straightforward.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Minato,,"I'll go with Option A. Even with the futons, the baths are better than the island.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,Option A for me. The travel time is reasonable and it's not as chaotic as the city.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Midori,,I vote for Option A. Knowing the total cost upfront is exactly what I wanted.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
